    "title": "Behance - Creative Portfolios",
    "description": "Showcase your work and discover inspiration from the world\u2019s best creative community on Behance.\u00a0\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\n\r\nInspiration at your fingertips:\r\n\u2022 Browse curated projects across 100s of creative fields, including graphic design, photography, illustration, 3D, art, and more.\r\n\u2022 Search for inspirational projects by specific tools, color, and more.\r\n\u2022 Build moodboards from projects that inspire you\r\n\r\nHire freelancers and get hired:\u00a0\r\n\u2022 Browse portfolios and hire talent for your freelance projects and pay artists safely and securely on platform\r\n\u2022 Edit your availability and let visitors know you\u2019re open to new opportunities, and get paid directly on Behance\r\n\u2022 Send and receive private messages and files\r\n\r\nConnect with the community:\u00a0\r\n\u2022 Follow artists and connect with a global network of creatives\r\n\u2022 Share your work and get feedback from the community\r\n\r\nSearch millions of projects across creative fields and industry, including:\u00a0\r\nGraphic Design\r\nPhotography\r\nIllustration\r\n3D art\r\nUI/UX\r\nMotion Graphics\r\nArchitecture\r\nProduct Design\r\nFashion\r\nAdvertising\r\nFine Arts\r\nCrafts\r\nGame Design\r\nSound Design\r\nand more!\r\n\r\nWHAT\u2019S NEW\u00a0\r\nWe\u2019ve improved features designed to help you get noticed by hirers and find new creative jobs.\u00a0\r\n\u2022 Edit your availability to let visitors know you\u2019re open to new opportunities\r\n\u2022 Create and send proposals to hirers and get paid directly on Behance\r\n\u2022 Share images, videos, and files through the Behance inbox\r\n\u2022 Connect and verify your social media accounts\r\n\r\nDownload now to join a thriving community of creatives!\r\n\r\nTerms & Conditions: Your use of this application is governed by:\r\nAdobe Terms of Use : https://protect.checkpoint.com/v2/___https://www.adobe.com/legal/terms-linkfree.html___.YzJ1Omxpb25icmlkZ2U6YzpvOmQ2YjcxM